padded according to ",[295,352,313],{},", and thousands separators are shown.",[340,355,356,357,359,360,362,363,366],{},"Non-numeric characters and decimals beyond the set places cannot be typed, and pasted text is reverted too. When ",[295,358,313],{}," is ",[295,361,317],{}," or ",[295,364,365],{},"0",", the decimal point cannot be typed.",[340,368,369,370,359,373,376,377,359,379,362,381,383,384,386],{},"On focus, the text switches to the editable form without separators. ",[295,371,372],{},"inputmode",[295,374,375],{},"numeric"," when ",[295,378,313],{},[295,380,317],{},[295,382,365],{},", and ",[295,385,313],{}," otherwise, so phones show the matching number keyboard.",[388,389,390,391,362,394,397,398,400,401,403,404,407,408,413,414,418],"tip",{},"The component has no ",[295,392,393],{},"min",[295,395,396],{},"max",". It is a text input underneath, so the native ",[295,399,393],{},", ",[295,402,396],{}," and ",[295,405,406],{},"step"," have no effect. Use ",[409,410,412],"a",{"href":411},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fform\u002Fvalidation","validation rules"," for ranges; see ",[409,415,417],{"href":416},"#with-form-validation","With form validation"," below.",[305,420,422],{"id":421},"unit","Unit",[292,424,425,426,359,428,430,431,434],{},"When ",[295,427,421],{},[295,429,321],{},", \"NTD\" is shown (\"元\" in Traditional Chinese, switching with the locale). The text can be changed in ",[409,432,47],{"href":433},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftheme\u002Fmessages#overridable-items","; passing a string shows that text. Units vary in length, so the right padding follows the unit's actual width and the number never overlaps the unit.",[333,436],{"name":437},"input-number-unit",[292,439,440,403,442,444,445,449,450,452,453,455,456,298],{},[295,441,421],{},[295,443,325],{}," can also have site-wide defaults; see ",[409,446,448],{"href":447},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftheme\u002Fcomponent-defaults#configurable-props","Configurable props",". The site-wide ",[295,451,421],{}," 